% Drafted CANONICAL rules. One group per header layout; run each layout's sample list with its group.

% L01 (151 recordings): EEG_F4_M1 -> F4_M1. Label F4-M1 is a referenced right frontal EEG derivation, and traces are mostly neuro. Evidence: 7 flag, 144 high
F4_M1
 group:
  L01
 req:
  sig = EEG_F4_M1
  unit = uV
  unit = mV
  unit = V
 set:
  unit = uV

